     "body": "<p>Legacy XACML:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Constants.ACTION.RI_FIND_OBJECTS.uri</li>\n\t<li>Constants.ACTION.APIA.uri</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Maybe implement a non-filtered version of the current operation handler with the above; the action can at least then be controlled by policies.</p>",
